<title>LITHUANIA: MINISTER SAYS FRANCE EYES LITHUANIAN TELECOM.</title>
<headline>MINISTER SAYS FRANCE EYES LITHUANIAN TELECOM.</headline>
<dateline>VILNIUS 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>European Affairs Minister Laima Andrikiene met the head of French telephone company France Telecom during a trip to Paris, the European Affairs ministry said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>It said in a statement that Andrikiene met France Telecom chief Mare Vignoles today and that the French group intended to take part in the privatisation of Lithuanian Telecom.</p>
<p>The government has said that it wants to sell some of Lithuanian Telecom as it hopes to accelerate to speed privatisation in the country.</p>
<p>-- Vilnius Newsroom +370 2 223 517</p>
</text>
